# Captain preferences

Copy this file to `~/.local/share/firstmate/data/captain.md` and fill it in.
It is per host and is never committed.

## Communication language

<Language Firstmate and crew should use when talking to you.>

## Working style

<How you like work to be done: level of autonomy, when to ask first, how much
detail to report, what to verify before calling something done.>

## Delivery preferences

<How changes should reach you: pull requests or direct commits, branch naming,
commit message style, what must pass before you review.>

## Credentials rule

<How agents must treat secrets: never print or commit them, where they may be
read from, and what to do when one is needed.>
